{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HsjCTVx7Rfa5XGL7sm6ZLi","type":"tool_result","content":"=== StatementScale 10-20\n    10\tThe logarithms in the target are natural logarithms, including at small inputs.\n    11\t-/\n    12\t\n    13\tnamespace SubexponentialSAT.SqrtLog.Statement\n    14\t\n    15\tnoncomputable section\n    16\t\n    17\t/-- The exact scale in the target, with the specified small-input shift. -/\n    18\tdef runtimeScale (n : ℕ) : ℝ :=\n    19\t  (n : ℝ) * (Real.log (Real.log ((n : ℝ) + 16))) ^ 2 /\n    20\t    Real.sqrt (Real.log ((n : ℝ) + 16))\n=== Statement.lean 1-16\n     1\timport OAI.Algorithms.SubexponentialSAT.SqrtLogSpace.Asymptotics\n     2\timport OAI.Algorithms.SubexponentialSAT.SqrtLogSpace.EncodingBounds\n     3\t\n     4\t/-! Numerical transport for the frozen endpoint signatures in `specification/main-theorem.md`.\n     5\tThe existence of the required finite counting program is not asserted in this module. -/\n     6\t\n     7\tnamespace OAI.Algorithms.SubexponentialSAT.SqrtLogSpace\n     8\t\n     9\ttheorem runtimeBound_le_eth {n k : ℕ} (F : SAT.CNF (Fin n))\n    10\t    (hw : SAT.WidthAtMost k F) (hn : 20 ≤ n) {C A : ℝ}\n    11\t    (hC : 0 ≤ C) (hA : 0 ≤ A) (d : ℕ) :\n    12\t    SqrtLog.Statement.runtimeBound C A d (Encoding.formulaBitLength F) n ≤\n    13\t      (C * ((8 * k + 7 : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ d) * ((n + F.card + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ (2 * d) *\n    14\t        (2 : ℝ) ^ ((4 * A) * rho n) := by\n    15\t  have hexponent : A * SqrtLog.Statement.runtimeScale n ≤ (4 * A) * rho n := by\n    16\t    calc\n=== EncodingBounds 15-19\n    15\t\n    16\t/-- Least-significant-bit-first binary, retaining one false bit for zero. -/\n    17\tdef countWord (a : ℕ) : List Bool := if a = 0 then [false] else a.bits\n    18\t\n    19\t@[simp] theorem countWord_zero : countWord 0 = [false] := rfl\n=== StatementCanonical 30-40\n    30\t/-- The machine and all constants may depend on width only. -/\n    31\tdef Feasi